Chapter 6 · Business Rules (change one, break everything)
═══════════════════════════════════════════
1. Three-branch pricing: flash price (inside window) > member price;
   strikethrough only when original > effective; case sale = packSpecs.
   Display / cart / order / checkout ALL go through utils/price.js.
2. Inventory: 0 out / >0 in / no record sold out; deduction only in the payment
   callback via deductBatch (reject whole order on shortage); case items deduct
   by bottle = qty × spec size; effective store = manual > geo > default first.
3. Shipping: pickup 0; delivery free when subtotal ≥ 200, otherwise flat 6
   (distance-based extensible); checkout shows "X more for free shipping"
   (freeShipGap = 200 − subtotal).
4. Cross-store cart: items bind storeId; key = product+spec+store; settle one
   store at a time (grouped chained createOrder); sync on store switch in
   onShow; legacy no-store items belong to the first store.
5. Order state machine: pending_pay→pending_ship→in_transit→completed
   (+cancelled/refund). Pickup orders use verifyCode + photos (images).
6. Permissions: see the adminApi matrix — do not "fix" it.
7. Points: premium keyword categories 1 pt/¥1, others 5 pt/¥1; tiers at
   0 / 100001 / 1500001; refunds claw points back.
8. Refunds: pre-shipment full incl. shipping; post-shipment goods only;
   idempotent.
9. Reviews: one per order-item; content safety blocks only "risky"; rating =
   (5+avg)/2.
10. Images: always convert to tcb.qcloud.la permanent links + encPath; ≤20
    main and ≤20 detail images; keep existing images when an edit uploads
    none; 404 = re-upload; 451 = CloudBase frozen for non-payment (top up).
11. Courier: fare recomputed server-side; courier returns prepaid by customer.
12. Public pub* endpoints (notices/activities/ads/rankings) live BEFORE auth
    checks; the frontend fetches on tab switch and falls back to static data.
13. Gift cards: card-number search = server-side regex in where; secrets
    encrypted with an env key; state machine inactive→activated→redeemed/frozen.
14. Pinyin search: element-level _py idempotency; cloud cache 10 min + 60s
    throttle.

