3. **cart**: cross-store grouping; selection (selectedIds/selectAll); totals
   (totalPrice/pointsTotal/availableCoupons/appliedCoupon/discountedTotal);
   pickup modal showPickupModal; stock refresh via list
4. **membership**: Memphis-style tier card (getTierGradientStyle); points
   progress bar progressWidth; tier roadmap showRoadmap; claimable coupons
5. **profile**: login state / role badges (isStaff/isAdmin/canSeed); system
   avatar picker (showAvatarModal+sysAvatars); feature-entry matrix (orders/
   coupons/points/favorites/history/addresses/returns/rankings/staff console/
   admin console)

## Transaction chain
6. **wine-detail**: main-image carousel = full image array; detail images
   rendered separately; favorite heart animation; packSpecs case picker;
   multi-store stock storeStocks (findStores); sold-out modal soldOutModal
   (soldOutStores); review aggregation (reviewAvg/featuredReview);
   add-to-cart / buy-now
7. **checkout**: grouped chained createOrder per store; points items via
   pointsApi deductForOrder; address pick/create; coupon sheet
   (usable/unusable); free-shipping gap freeShipGap; delivery method
