Chapter 9 · Pitfalls (hard-earned)
═══════════════════════════════════════════
- Re-read .wxss from disk before editing + balance braces; delete style blocks
  with exact matches
- Record original values before tests mutate real data; restore afterwards
- Historical store-id gaps are a migration artifact — do not re-sequence
- A React context missing a value prop → blank page (tsc passes, runtime
  crashes); after adding a field, grep the value block
- Cloud DB client limit 100 → paginate with skip; _.in limited to 20 → batch;
  querying users by openid must tolerate _openid
- New adminApi actions go inside the main try block, or they 404 after deploy
- Local printing / notification sounds use 127.0.0.1 — store machines only
- 451 = CloudBase frozen for non-payment; top up — not a code bug
- Product CSV import = match-and-update by id, no deletes; the export IS the
  import template

